  "notes": "## [0.2.1](https://github.com/juantoledo/shortwave-atlas/compare/v0.2.0...v0.2.1) (2026-10-09)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n\r\n* **desktop:** Ko-fi button in the top bar, opened in the system browser ([01dea35](https://github.com/juantoledo/shortwave-atlas/commit/01dea35f761a1900174f893d085bbefc226baa93))\r\n* **desktop:** name the window Shortwave Atlas and show the version ([f166316](https://github.com/juantoledo/shortwave-atlas/commit/f166316b56675df0814785a2dc9187f0190c6437))\r\n* **stations:** load the EiBi shortwave schedule in place of the sample data ([1bd8141](https://github.com/juantoledo/shortwave-atlas/commit/1bd8141583cc22dfa0f76447a533708ce815b6d9))\r\n* **ui:** browse the catalog by search, band, language, target and country, with flags ([8395d44](https://github.com/juantoledo/shortwave-atlas/commit/8395d44223c782329eb3289d9faf1e74b70e7c52))\r\n* **ui:** keyboard shortcuts ([23155ff](https://github.com/juantoledo/shortwave-atlas/commit/23155ff65f7b15264a253bcfc8c86da23080eb6f))\r\n* **ui:** styled dropdowns and a model combobox in Settings ([69e8445](https://github.com/juantoledo/shortwave-atlas/commit/69e8445081782a8eb4683ede41bba65bd3611acc))\r\n\r\n\r\n### Documentation\r\n\r\n* describe the EiBi data and credit EiBi and flag-icons ([c265753](https://github.com/juantoledo/shortwave-atlas/commit/c265753475da526c57271e4c7fa0f9b3e77d97b0))\r\n\r\n\r\n### Miscellaneous Chores\r\n\r\n* release 0.2.1 ([0d2cd42](https://github.com/juantoledo/shortwave-atlas/commit/0d2cd426df04de27c1477a91f8b175a471ee6cf2))\n",
